운전모드 설정 확인</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="7" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2048" Protect="false" RowAddr="12" RowSpan="1" Width="35576"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>*현장설정치</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="7" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="5448" Protect="false" RowAddr="13" RowSpan="1" Width="35576"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>설정예시) 제조사별로 메뉴명 단위 상이</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>AVR Control : AVR Control, AVR Control Time : 60s</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>AVR Control V1 : 104%, AVR Control V3 : 106%</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="5" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2231" Protect="false" RowAddr="14" RowSpan="1" Width="28702"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><CHAR>Q(V) 운전모드 기능</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="5" ColSpan="3" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2231" Protect="false" RowAddr="14" RowSpan="1" Width="17222"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="33"><CHAR>■</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="12"><CHAR> 활성</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="8" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="9463" Protect="false" RowAddr="15" RowSpan="1" Width="45924"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>1) 상기 기술기준의 전압/주파수 기준범위를 만족하도록 인버터를 설정하고, 현장 설정치 작성 및 인버터 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>  </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="15"><CHAR>설정 사진(HMI 또는 APP)을 첨부</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>하시기 바랍니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>  * </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="15"><CHAR>설정확인 화면(HMI, APP)이 없는</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR> 인버터는 인버터 설정치에 대한 제조사 공문서를 사진 대신 첨부</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>2) 인버터 제조사 및 모델명이 서로 다르거나 설정치가 상이한 경우 확인서를 각각 작성하시기 바랍니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>3) </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="15"><CHAR>허위의 정보를 제공하거나, 자료를 제출한 경우</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR> 송배전용전기설비 이용규정 제72조 및 전력구입계약서</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="25" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>   제22조에 따라 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="15"><CHAR>이용정지 또는 계약이 해지</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="13"><CHAR>될 수 있습니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="26" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"/></P><P ParaShape="26" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>위와 같이 인버터 정보 및 전압/주파수 분리시간, 역률제어기능 대한 설정치를 제출하며, </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="16"><CHAR>분산형전원 배전계통 연계기술기준 제13조 및 제24조의 기준범위를 만족함을 확인합니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="26" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"/></P><P ParaShape="26" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="30"><CHAR>§DATE§</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="26" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"/></P><P ParaShape="26" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"/></P><P ParaShape="27" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>고객 :   </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="30"><CHAR>§SIGN§    (서명)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"/></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"/></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><HEADER ApplyPageType="Both" SeriesNum="1"><PARALIST HasNumRef="false" HasTextRef="false" LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" TextHeight="4252" TextWidth="48190" VertAlign="Top"><P ParaShape="36" Style="13"><TEXT CharShape="2"/></P></PARALIST></HEADER><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"/></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"/></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"/></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"/></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"/></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"/></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"/></P><P ParaShape="30" Style="23"><TEXT CharShape="23"><RECTANGLE Ratio="0" X0="0" X1="6330" X2="6330" X3="0" Y0="0" Y1="0" Y2="2137" Y3="2137"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1791871869" Lock="false" NumberingType="Figure" ZOrder="4"><SIZE Height="2566" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="6330" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="true" FlowWithText="false" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>사각형입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><DRAWINGOBJECT><SHAPECOMPONENT CurHeight="2566" GroupLevel="0" HorzFlip="false" InstID="718130046" OriHeight="2137" OriWidth="6330" VertFlip="false" XPos="0" YPos="0"><ROTATIONINFO Angle="0" CenterX="3165" CenterY="1283" Rotate="1"/><RENDERINGINFO><TRANSMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00